"Co-working spaces"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Retail Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Stores"},{"text":"Showrooms"},{"text":"Brand experience"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare Interiors"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hospitals"},{"text":"Clinics"},{"text":"Wellness facilities"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Requires deeper knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Infection control"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Patient circulation"},{"text":"Healthcare regulations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sustainable Interior Architecture"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Circular materials"},{"text":"Adaptive reuse"},{"text":"Low-carbon interiors"},{"text":"Energy efficiency"}]},{"type":"h","text":"BIM & Computational Interior Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Interior Architecture","BIM","Parametric/Computational Design"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Design Track"},{"type":"flow","items":["Architecture / Interior Design Intern","Junior Interior Architect","Interior Architect","Senior Interior Architect","Lead Interior Architect","Design Director","Principal Designer / Studio Partner"]},{"type":"h","text":"Business Track"},{"type":"flow","items":["Junior Interior Architect","Project Architect / Designer","Project Lead","Studio Manager","Design Director","Studio Founder / Principal"]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Interior architecture is increasingly influenced by:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BIM"},{"text":"Computational design"},{"text":"Parametric modelling"},{"text":"AI-assisted design"},{"text":"Generative design"},{"text":"Virtual reality"},{"text":"Augmented reality"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Real-time rendering"},{"text":"3D scanning"},{"text":"LiDAR-based site capture"},{"text":"3D printing"},{"text":"Smart buildings"},{"text":"IoT-enabled interiors"},{"text":"Sustainable material databases"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A particularly valuable future combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Interior Architecture","BIM","Computational Design","Real-Time Visualization","AI"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Spatial Planning"},{"text":"Interior Architecture"},{"text":"Ergonomics"},{"text":"Design Thinking"},{"text":"Freehand Sketching"},{"text":"Concept Development"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Construction"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Construction Detailing"},{"text":"Joinery"},{"text":"Building Services"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Acoustics"},{"text":"BOQ"},{"text":"Site Coordination"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"Revit"},{"text":"SketchUp"},{"text":"Rhino"},{"text":"3ds Max / Blender"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visualization"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Enscape"},{"text":"V-Ray"},{"text":"Lumion"},{"text":"Twinmotion / D5"},{"text":"Photoshop"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BIM"},{"text":"Computational Design"},{"text":"Parametric Modelling"},{"text":"Digital Twins"},{"text":"VR / AR"},{"text":"AI-Assisted Design"},{"text":"Sustainable Design"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong B.Arch graduate targeting Interior Architecture should be able to take a project from client brief to construction:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Client Brief","Site Analysis","Space Programming","Concept Development","Space Planning","3D/BIM Model","Materials + Lighting","Construction Drawings","BOQ / Costing","Vendor Coordination","Site Execution","Final Interior"]},{"type":"p","text":"Their portfolio should ideally contain 4–6 complete projects, not merely attractive renders. Each project should show plans + sections + elevations + material palette + details + 3D views + design reasoning."}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For B.Arch — Architecture → Interior Architect, the strongest positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Architectural Designer","Interior Architecture Specialist","BIM/Visualization Professional"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The graduate should not position themselves merely as a decorator. The differentiating skills are:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Spatial Planning","Construction Detailing","Materials","BIM","Visualization","Building Services","Site Execution."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For a future-ready 2026+ profile, add:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BIM","Computational Design","AI-assisted visualization","Sustainable Materials","Smart Building Technology."],"sep":"+"}]}]}